  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Roasted Brussels Sprouts",
  "description": "These Brussels sprouts and cipollini onions are parboiled then roasted with butter, salt, and pepper until caramelized and tender in this Chef John recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
